        "text": "Let's face the fact, when it comes to crypto ownership, there's a significant gender gap. A study found that only 37% of crypto owners are women. But this number doesn't scare us. In fact, it empowers us. At Binance, we see this gap as an opportunity for women across the world to take ownership of the future of finance. We believe that determined daughters, strong sisters, motivated mothers and fierce friends are radical, passionate, super women who can change the world. So whether you're a queen of crypto or just crypto curious, Binance is your hub for crypto savings payments and Web3 education. The future is yours. Build it with us.",
